      "body": "Exact-head self-review at `64a56f40991ce1faab4867b49e50800fc5fc30bd` (Claude lab, landing DeepSeek's Phase 2a record; owner rule: self-review allowed). Merged origin/main (incl. the flash read #1809): the parity-test conflict was two independent appended tests — resolved by taking main's file and appending this PR's `test_chunked_recurrence_parity` unchanged; then rustfmt on this PR's code (whitespace only). Checks at this head: laptop `cargo check -p uor-r4-training --lib --tests` 0 errors; RTX 5090 pod bootstrap at this exact sha: `cuda_stack_ops_parity` **37 passed, 0 failed** (incl. chunked recurrence and flash read parity). Chunked recurrence stays opt-in (`UOR_R4_CUDA_RECURRENCE=chunked`), default unchanged. APPROVE.",
